E-mail: <a>dairyassist@gmail.com</a>  </span></p>
<p><strong>Click the relevant links to download:</strong></p>
<p>Do &#8216;Like&#8217; our Facebook page for regular updates: <a title="Facebook page of Vet Helpline India Pvt Ltd." href="http://www.facebook.com/vethelplineindia.co.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Click Here</a></p>
<p><a href="http://www.asci-india.com/National%20Occupation%20Standards.php#">National Occupational Standard for Dairy Farmer / Entrepreneur </a></p>
