            <div id="text-9" class="widget-wrapper widget_text">			<div class="textwidget"><img class="alignright size-medium wp-image-478" alt="WVD2" src=" http://www.vethelplineindia.co.in/wp-content/uploads/2016/01/Mahatma-Gandhi-AnimalWelfare.jpg" width="300" height="225" />


